## Project

**Aegis — AI Connector Governance Platform.** A workbench that takes a GenAI connector request from intake to an audit-ready decision record: structured eight-domain risk scoring, AI-assisted draft assessment, human-confirmed findings mapped to OWASP LLM Top 10 / STRIDE / NIST AI RMF / ISO 42001, and an immutable decision trail.

The problem it addresses is real and current: enterprises are enabling connectors — ChatGPT to Drive, Claude to Slack, Zoom AI to everything — faster than security can review them, and the reviews that do happen are inconsistent, slow, and leave no defensible record.

